Scope note (not part of the MIT text above)

This license covers the reconstruction work contributed by Mingxi Wu: the
pipeline in tools/, the module structure under src/, the documentation under
docs/, and the build output in dist/ insofar as it is generated by that work.

The game itself — its design, code, art, audio and text — originates from a
prior work by another author, present in this repository as
input/saltline.original.html and faithfully reproduced in src/. Copyright in
that material remains with its original author. This repository is a
reverse-engineering study of that work and grants no rights to the original
content beyond what the original author has granted.
